ng", "id": "1110264864954406", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623551_1110264868287739_9141166805763674216_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fjcy6x7HOFEQ7kNvwFf9Dac&_nc_oc=Adr_byauNQSwLF9QdHXSQJO-8NHloXzw8Vtv9x3C8-jkj3yCScoSeDLn7WCVsWwXcPc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSUy_K-rGY0vNUY51-MVFVLuo13UE0SNNgAkY71q53X4Q&oe=6AFB4009"}, {"file_name": "\u622a\u56fe1.png", "id": "1658283682637899", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593878539_1658283685971232_3799221318757258192_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9C7J6R1SlPkQ7kNvwH15gn0&_nc_oc=AdqoCkVlfQpJWboEjVCyLo91txPEmCPgzFutmcmU1wfkysy3e9MImJ3bHnpaCyU1XPk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTkXLod3KxqG-9ap99Xdx4A1iof_SvElSDUybJ6jlJiNw&oe=6AFB42E7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer Cover Image.png", "id": "1751442152620495", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620655_1751442155953828_7807634497302582929_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Yn74wY6Kgj8Q7kNvwE2QUKa&_nc_oc=AdpjE57Nje9DqJxgf7loVESKZUp-s_EOKo9X3V-RGnKyf7wSXnPQAKfNM8rIC9jrgwk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRKks0ylV1qMxFnBv3ZlRBGowUKHmMkZWojUCWNjvxvwA&oe=6AFB2BB0"}, "display_name": "MemoVR Player", "keywords": ["player", "osmo", "fisheye", "q3u"], "long_description": "# MemoVR Player\n\n**Make VR a simpler way to record life**\n\n## Overview\n\n- Browse and manage standard SBS ERP VR180 MP4, JPG, and PNG files.\n- Open native VR-camera video and JPG/PNG photos with real-time stabilization\u2014no complex export step after shooting (currently DJI Osmo 360 modded and QooCam 3 Ultra modded; more cameras to follow).\n- Supports on-device storage, camera USB, and LAN SMB shares (read/write enables delete) for easier VR media management.\n\n## Supported formats\n-  `.osv`: Dual-fisheye (e.g. DJI), 190\u00b0 fisheye playback, real-time stab \n- QooCam 3 Ultra dual fisheye : Aspect ~1:2 \u2192 top/bottom fisheye (200\u00b0), real-time stab \nOther `.mp4` : Aspect ~2:1 \u2192 SBS ERP VR180; otherwise flat 2D \n- `.jpg` / `.jpeg` / `.png` :  Aspect ~2:1 \u2192 SBS ERP VR180; otherwise flat 2D \n\n## Author\n\n- Author: memovr\n- Email: memovr180@gmail.com\n", "short_description": "Make VR a simpler way to record life.\n\n1. Browse and manage standard SBS ERP VR180 MP4, JPG, and PNG files.\n2. Open native VR-camera video and JPG/PNG photos with real-time stabilization\u2014no complex export step after shooting (currently DJI Osmo 360 modded and QooCam 3 Ultra modded; more cameras to follow).\n3. Supports on-device storage, camera USB, and LAN SMB shares (read/write enables delete) for easier VR media management."}]}, "developer_name": "memovr", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://yuquant.github.io/memovr/privacy_policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "memovr", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://yuquant.github.io/memovr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "zh_CN"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1453076147883303"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499626806_150332953